# ProjectBrain Charter

## Vision

A personal project intelligence system that learns from multiple projects over time, identifies deep patterns correlating with success and failure, and serves context to AI coding agents.

## Current Phase

M1–M4 in progress: hybrid storage, agent hooks, intelligence engine, evolution digest + adoption eval.

## Architecture

- Local-first SQLite storage in `.projectbrain/`
- MCP server for Cursor agent tools
- Event outbox for async projections (graph/vector in M3+)

## Success Criteria

- Agents receive project context without user running commands
- Decisions and reflections persist across sessions
- Cross-project pattern learning by M3
